out.push(A('⚠ **_Whereas_ is audible and the room will name it without being told what to listen for.** **One reading at one pitch, one reading with _whereas_ in the middle, and the question: which half did the second version prefer?** **They always know.** **Then the point that makes it a C1 lesson rather than a style note: the writer did not intend a preference** — **and _whereas_, _on the other hand_ and _while_ all insert one for free.** **In a document with three readers an accidental preference is a bet made without knowing it.**'));
