out.push(A('The pair chosen, the ground, and whether the turn ended on a full stop. ⚠ **In Set One the failing pair is B and C; in Set Two it is A and C.** **About half the class picks a non-working pair and finds out at twenty seconds**, and that is worth letting happen once. **What to do when it happens: let them finish badly, and then ask which pairing they tried first.** **It is almost always the two they thought were the best photographs.** ⚠ **Then the finding, from the picture editor: if the one you left out is the strongest single image, you have probably chosen right.**'));
