out.push(A('**2** ⚠ **The pair will be read as a picture about children**, and two of the four newspapers that take the service will crop C to the boy and drop A. **The only thing that works is filing C at a width that cannot be cropped square** — **and he says plainly that he would rather they did not and they will.**'));
out.push(A('**3** ⚠ **The main itself, behind hoarding; anybody from the municipality or the directorate; and the disputed order, which is paper and cannot be photographed.** **The last of the three is the reason the story exists at all** — **and the related point in his second note is that the notice, which is the one document that can be photographed, is illegible at the width the service files at.**'));
