out.push(A('⚠ **Two timed rounds and a count between them, and the count is the whole of the stage.** **First round: how many finished on a full stop?** **Two or three of ten.** **Second round: most of them.** **Ask what changed, and the answer is almost always that somebody dropped a speculation they had planned to make.** **Say the consequence plainly: at C1 the long turn is not short of material, it is short of time** — **and the candidates who lose marks here are the ones with most to say.** **Mrs Ajouz has the recording and says so herself.**'));
