out.push(A('⚠ **Stop and restart, out loud, every single time.** **Any turn beginning with _so_, _I_ or _as_ goes back to the beginning.** **Most people need two restarts and then never do it again**, and the two restarts are worth more than any amount of explanation, because the opening is a reflex and not a decision. **Then the count: how many of the ten opened on a content word at the first attempt?** **Usually two.** **Say so, and say that the other eight are not weaker speakers** — **they are politer ones, and the task does not reward it.**'));
