out.push(A('**1** ⚠ _Of the three questions, the first two can be answered from this school\'s own records and the third cannot be answered by a head teacher at all._ **A property**, and it could be wrong — **somebody could show that a head\'s records bear on governorate policy** — **which is exactly what makes it checkable.**'));
out.push(A('**2** ⚠ **The question as asked is about teaching time, and form period is not teaching time in the ministry\'s own definition** (circular 118/2 of 2019, paragraph four), **so teaching time is unaffected.** **The question as meant is about what form period is for** — attendance, uniform, notes from home, anything a pupil needs to say to an adult — **and there the answer is that individual conversations have fallen from about nineteen a week to about eleven.** **He answers both and labels them.**'));
out.push(A('**3** ⚠ **The form-period figure from four schools that have made the change and four that have not, over one term.** **He has the figure for his own school and offers it to whoever is collecting them** — **and then the sting: _if nobody is collecting them, that is the answer to the third question._** **Fourteen words, and the only sentence in the reply that is about the ministry.**'));
