out.push(S('Stage 3R · Perform – listener task'));
out.push(A('What each conclusion adds. ⚠ **The four marked rows add nothing and they fail in two different ways, and the distinction is worth the five minutes.** **_Both points are clearly very important_ and _there are arguments on both sides_ decide nothing.** **_I have discussed two of the three points above_ and _I believe my view is the correct one_ describe the essay instead of concluding it.** **The second pair is the dangerous one**, because it feels like structure. ⚠ **Put the covering test on it, from 1.6: cover the sentence and ask whether anything in the essay is now unknown.** **Nothing is**, and the class has its own tool for a fault it meets in the examination.'));
out.push(S('Stage 4 · Your turn (sample)'));
