out.push(NOTE('⚠ **This cycle is the third mediation in three units and the three moves have not changed, and the class should be made to notice that.** **Say what is correct. Show the writer their own sentence. Ask one question. Stop.** **1.7 showed her her own two sentences joined; 2.7 asked what each reader does on Tuesday; 3.7 reads her her own last clause.** **Put the three on the board together** — **it is the only place in Book 1 where the method of the x.7 cycles is visible as a method**, and it will be needed in 11.7 and in Book 2. ⚠ **And the finding that is new here is about readers rather than writers: a reader who praises you is as little use as one who objects.** **Both stopped at the same place, and the only useful reader was the one who noticed something and got the reason wrong.** **Mr Shihabi says it and it is the sentence to leave the unit on.**'));
