out.push(A('⚠ **Part 1 is one mark an item and it is almost entirely collocation, so the question is never _what does this mean_ but _what goes with this_.** **Teach the two-step: read to the end of the sentence, then try each option aloud with the words immediately after the gap.** **Item 4 is the one to go over** — ⚠ **_boiled down to_ is the phrase most candidates reach for and it is not an option, and three of the four options are phrasal verbs that do not take _to_.** **Item 7 is the distractor set worth five minutes: _chime with_ and _line up with_ both mean to agree**, and the sentence needs the opposite, **so two of the four options are wrong for the same reason and a candidate who has not read to the end of the sentence will take one of them.**'));
